I have uploaded version 0.7 of this patch:

http://nethack.edeca.net/karl/nethack-convict-0.7.diff

Changes, based on recent feedback, include:

 * Slightly more forgiving early game: no more luck penalty, and the
convict loses nutrition at half the normal rate, but only when he
reaches "hungry" or worse.  The starting nutrition and negative
starting alignment are unchanged, however.

 * The quest nemesis, as well as a number of the other quest bad guys
have been beefed-up to provide a greater challenge on the quest.

 * The Iron Ball of Liberation starts on the same square as Warden
Arianna, as intended.

